                                "sense_id": "2157297d-b6ff-3652-92e5-89d8f74530e7",
                                "text": "Ik ga enorm veel boze brieven naar de uitgever sturen met de eis dat ze de reeks stopzetten.",
                                "translation": "I am going to write an enormous quantity of angry letters to the publisher with the demand that they will cancel the series.",
